<title>USA: Meritage Hospitality shares sold.</title>
<headline>Meritage Hospitality shares sold.</headline>
<dateline>GRAND RAPIDS, Mich. 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Meritage Hospitality Group Inc said Tuesday the remaining 860,148 shares of company stock owned by Donald Reynolds, a former majority shareholder, and his affiliates were sold.</p>
<p>The shares were sold under a global settlement entered into last month regarding all claims against Reynolds and the company's former management.</p>
<p>The sales were completed more than 230 days ahead of the sale period authorized by the settlement agreement, the company said.</p>
<p>Meritage owns and operates three full-service hotels in Michigan.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
